    subtitle: "超高圧均質化マイクロギャップ剪断（100〜300 MPa）と高強度キセノンパルスUV-C光（200〜280 nm、5〜40 J/cm²）を環状薄膜石英リアクター内で連続統合し、熱変性・加熱臭を生じさせずに混濁果汁や液卵中の耐熱性細菌芽胞を >6-log 完全不活化。ASME Section VIII、3-A 04-05/44-03、USDA-FSIS 9 CFR § 590、および FDA 21 CFR § 120 Juice HACCP に完全適合。",
    controlsTitle: "DHPH-PUVC 流体力学＆フォトニック制御パラメータ",
    controlsSub: "均質化剪断圧力、パルスUVフルエンス、キセノン放電周波数、環状流路ギャップ厚さ、液体流量、および入口温度を設定します。",
    systemLabel: "連続プロセススキッド設計＆反応器システム：",
    systemHelp: "産業用高耐久統合スキッド、サニタリー薄膜渦流リアクター、低温液卵無変性殺菌装置、またはクリーンルーム実証用パイロットスキッドを選択。",
    matrixLabel: "処理対象食品流体マトリクス＆高リスク微生物叢：",
    matrixHelp: "混濁柑橘果汁（耐酸耐熱アリシクロバチルス芽胞）、全液卵/卵白（サルモネラ菌・セレウス菌）、バリスタ用オーツミルク、生ココナッツウォーター、または脱脂乳を選択。",
    nozzleLabel: "均質化マイクロ流路オリフィス幾何形状：",
    nozzleHelp: "多結晶ダイヤモンド対向ノズル (4 µm)、ジルコニア Z流路バルブ、超硬タングステン微小フラット弁、または低圧スプリング弁（危険対照）を選択。",
    puvcLabel: "パルスUV-C 環状石英光リアクター構造：",
    puvcHelp: "高乱流合成石英薄膜チャンバー (0.35 mm)、スパイラル旋回流チューブ、同軸二重ジャケット、または広口径静止パイプ（危険対照）を選択。",
    pressureLabel: "均質化微細剪断圧力 (P_homo)：",
    pressureHelp: "ノズル前後の流体差圧（50〜300 MPa）。微粒子のナノ微細化、菌体クラスター解離、および細胞膜への機械的剪断負荷を決定します。",
    fluenceLabel: "パルスUV-C 表面フルエンス (F_puvc)：",
    fluenceHelp: "石英表面におけるピーク放射エネルギー（5.0〜45.0 J/cm²）。DNA鎖中のシクロブタンピリミジン二量体 (CPD) 形成効率を支配します。",
    freqLabel: "キセノン放電パルス周波数 (f_pulse)：",
    freqHelp: "パルス放電の繰り返し周波数（5〜30 Hz）。薄膜滞留時間内に照射される累積重複パルス数を決定します。",
    gapLabel: "環状薄膜流路ギャップ厚さ (δ_gap)：",
    gapHelp: "内側合成石英管と外側サニタリーハウジング間の流体膜厚（0.20〜2.00 mm）。不透明液中での光学的浸透深さを支配します。",
    flowLabel: "連続流体処理流量 (Q_liquid)：",
    flowHelp: "連続処理スキッドの毎時流体処理能力（200〜6,000 L/h）。",
    tempLabel: "供給流体入口温度 (T_inlet)：",
    tempHelp: "処理前の流体温度（10.0〜45.0 °C）。液卵タンパク質の熱凝固閾値（T < 52°C）に対する安全マージンを管理します。",
    presetsTitle: "産業用標準プロセスプリセット：",
    presetCitrus: "混濁柑橘果汁 アリシクロバチルス耐熱芽胞 6-Log 完全殺菌",
    presetEgg: "全液卵 サルモネラ菌非加熱・熱凝固ゼロ無菌化",
    presetOat: "バリスタ用オーツミルク 長期常温保存 (ESL) 均質＆低温滅菌",
    presetCoconut: "生ココナッツウォーター 酵素褐変防止・非加熱冷殺菌",
    presetHazard: "低剪断・厚膜による紫外線透過不良＆芽胞未殺滅の危険状態",
    diagnosticTitle: "リアルタイム遠隔計測データ＆微生物不活化動力学",
    diagnosticSub: "細菌芽胞対数減少値、薄膜光透過率、最大流体剪断速度、流体温升、タンパク質健全性、および衛生規格準拠状況を連続シミュレート。",
    logReductionLabel: "細菌芽胞対数不活化深度 (Log10 N0/N)：",
    transmittanceLabel: "薄膜流路における実効光透過率：",
    shearLabel: "最大動的流体剪断速度 (γ_dot)：",
    tempRiseLabel: "流体機械的温升 (ΔT_fluid)：",
    retentionLabel: "ビタミンC＆天然アロマ残存率：",
    energyLabel: "比エネルギー消費量 (SEC)：",
    throughputLabel: "連続製造スループット：",
    statusLabel: "衛生規格＆無菌化達成ステータス：",
    diagramTitle: "二段相乗プロセス：流体力学剪断空化ノズル＆環状石英薄膜パルスUVチャンバー構造図",
    diagramSub: "超高圧プランジャーポンプ、ダイヤモンド微細ノズル、環状乱流薄膜石英管、高輝度キセノンパルスアレイ、および無菌充填ライン。",
    scienceTitle: "DHPH-PUVC の科学的基礎＆光生物学的流体物理メカニズム",
    scienceSub: "流体超高剪断クラスタ解離、レイリー・プレセット空洞崩壊、ピリミジンダイマー形成光不活化、およびワイブル相乗殺菌モデルの詳説。",
    tableTitle: "商用システム主要技術仕様＆殺菌パラメータ比較基準表"
  }
};

const d = DICT[lang];
---

<div class="bg-surface-soft border border-hairline rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 lg:p-10 shadow-sm mb-12">
  <!-- Header Badge & Titles -->
  <div class="mb-8">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
      <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-violet-950 text-violet-200 border border-violet-800">
        {d.badge}
      </span>
      <span class="text-xs text-muted font-mono">DHPH-PUVC &bull; 100&ndash;300 MPa &bull; 200&ndash;280 nm &bull; 3-A 04-05 &bull; FDA 21 CFR § 120</span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-extrabold text-ink tracking-tight mb-3">
      {d.title}
    </h1>
    <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-muted leading-relaxed max-w-5xl">
      {d.subtitle}
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Presets -->
  <div class="mb-8 bg-surface border border-hairline rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-5">
    <div class="text-xs font-bold text-muted uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">
      {d.presetsTitle}
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
      <button type="button" id="dhph-preset-citrus" class="px-3 py-2 text-xs font-semibold rounded-xl bg-surface-soft hover:bg-violet-900/40 text-ink border border-hairline transition-all">
        🍊 {d.presetCitrus}
      </button>
      <button type="button" id="dhph-preset-egg" class="px-3 py-2 text-xs font-semibold rounded-xl bg-surface-soft hover:bg-violet-900/40 text-ink border border-hairline transition-all">
        🥚 {d.presetEgg}
      </button>
      <button type="button" id="dhph-preset-oat" class="px-3 py-2 text-xs font-semibold rounded-xl bg-surface-soft hover:bg-violet-900/40 text-ink border border-hairline transition-all">
        🌾 {d.presetOat}
      </button>
      <button type="button" id="dhph-preset-coconut" class="px-3 py-2 text-xs font-semibold rounded-xl bg-surface-soft hover:bg-violet-900/40 text-ink border border-hairline transition-all">
        🥥 {d.presetCoconut}
      </button>
      <button type="button" id="dhph-preset-hazard" class="px-3 py-2 text-xs font-semibold rounded-xl bg-rose-950/30 hover:bg-rose-900/50 text-rose-300 border border-rose-800/60 transition-all">
        ⚠️ {d.presetHazard}
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Interactive Controls Grid -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 mb-10">
    <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
      <div class="bg-surface border border-hairline rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-6 shadow-xs">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink mb-1">{d.controlsTitle}</h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-muted mb-6 leading-relaxed">{d.controlsSub}</p>

        <div class="space-y-5">
          <!-- System Architecture -->
          <div>
            <label for="dhph-system-select" class="block text-xs font-semibold text-ink mb-1">
              {d.systemLabel}
            </label>
            <select id="dhph-system-select" class="w-full bg-surface-soft border border-hairline rounded-xl px-3 py-2 text-sm text-ink focus:outline-none focus:border-violet-500">
              {dhphData.systemArchitectures.map(sys => (
                <option value={sys.id}>{sys.name}</option>
              ))}
            </select>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-muted mt-1">{d.systemHelp}</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Target Beverage Matrix -->
          <div>
            <label for="dhph-matrix-select" class="block text-xs font-semibold text-ink mb-1">
              {d.matrixLabel}
            </label>
            <select id="dhph-matrix-select" class="w-full bg-surface-soft border border-hairline rounded-xl px-3 py-2 text-sm text-ink focus:outline-none focus:border-violet-500">
              {dhphData.targetMatrices.map(mat => (
                <option value={mat.id}>{mat.name} ({mat.targetPathogen})</option>
              ))}
            </select>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-muted mt-1">{d.matrixHelp}</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Homogenizer Interaction Nozzle -->
          <div>
            <label for="dhph-nozzle-select" class="block text-xs font-semibold text-ink mb-1">
              {d.nozzleLabel}
            </label>
            <select id="dhph-nozzle-select" class="w-full bg-surface-soft border border-hairline rounded-xl px-3 py-2 text-sm text-ink focus:outline-none focus:border-violet-500">
              {dhphData.homogenizerNozzles.map(noz => (
                <option value={noz.id}>{noz.name} ({noz.microGapUm} µm gap)</option>
              ))}
            </select>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-muted mt-1">{d.nozzleHelp}</p>
          </div>

          <!-- PUVC Reactor Geometry -->
          <div>
            <label for="dhph-puvc-select" class="block text-xs font-semibold text-ink mb-1">
              {d.puvcLabel}
            </label>
            <select id="dhph-puvc-select" class="w-full bg-surface-soft border border-hairline rounded-xl px-3 py-2 text-sm text-ink focus:outline-none focus:border-violet-500">
              {dhphData.puvcReactorGeometries.map(geo => (
                <option value={geo.id}>{geo.name}</option>
              ))}
            </select>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-muted mt-1">{d.puvcHelp}</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Slider 1: Homogenization Shearing Pressure (MPa) -->
          <div>
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-1">
              <label for="dhph-pressure" class="text-xs font-semibold text-ink">
                {d.pressureLabel}
              </label>
              <span id="dhph-pressure-val" class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-violet-400">180.0 MPa</span>
            </div>
            <input 
              type="range" 
              id="dhph-pressure" 
              min="50.0" 
              max="300.0" 
              step="5.0" 
              value="180.0" 
              class="w-full accent-violet-600 bg-surface-soft h-2 rounded-lg cursor-pointer" 
            />
            <p class="text-[11px] text-muted mt-1">{d.pressureHelp}</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Slider 2: Pulsed UV-C Surface Fluence (J/cm²) -->
          <div>
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-1">
              <label for="dhph-fluence" class="text-xs font-semibold text-ink">
                {d.fluenceLabel}
              </label>
              <span id="dhph-fluence-val" class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-violet-400">25.0 J/cm²</span>
            </div>
            <input 
              type="range" 
              id="dhph-fluence" 
              min="5.0" 
              max="45.0" 
              step="1.0" 
              value="25.0" 
              class="w-full accent-violet-600 bg-surface-soft h-2 rounded-lg cursor-pointer" 
            />
            <p class="text-[11px] text-muted mt-1">{d.fluenceHelp}</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Slider 3: Flash Pulse Frequency (Hz) -->
          <div>
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-1">
              <label for="dhph-freq" class="text-xs font-semibold text-ink">
                {d.freqLabel}
              </label>
              <span id="dhph-freq-val" class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-violet-400">20 Hz</span>
            </div>
            <input 
              type="range" 
              id="dhph-freq" 
              min="5" 
              max="30" 
              step="1" 
              value="20" 
              class="w-full accent-violet-600 bg-surface-soft h-2 rounded-lg cursor-pointer" 
            />
            <p class="text-[11px] text-muted mt-1">{d.freqHelp}</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Slider 4: Annular Gap Thickness (mm) -->
          <div>
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-1">
              <label for="dhph-gap" class="text-xs font-semibold text-ink">
                {d.gapLabel}
              </label>
              <span id="dhph-gap-val" class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-violet-400">0.35 mm</span>
            </div>
            <input 
              type="range" 
              id="dhph-gap" 
              min="0.20" 
              max="2.00" 
              step="0.05" 
              value="0.35" 
              class="w-full accent-violet-600 bg-surface-soft h-2 rounded-lg cursor-pointer" 
            />
            <p class="text-[11px] text-muted mt-1">{d.gapHelp}</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Slider 5: Flow Rate (L/h) -->
          <div>
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-1">
              <label for="dhph-flow" class="text-xs font-semibold text-ink">
                {d.flowLabel}
              </label>
              <span id="dhph-flow-val" class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-violet-400">3200 L/h</span>
            </div>
            <input 
              type="range" 
              id="dhph-flow" 
              min="200" 
              max="6000" 
              step="100" 
              value="3200" 
              class="w-full accent-violet-600 bg-surface-soft h-2 rounded-lg cursor-pointer" 
            />
            <p class="text-[11px] text-muted mt-1">{d.flowHelp}</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Slider 6: Inlet Temperature (°C) -->
          <div>
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-1">
              <label for="dhph-temp" class="text-xs font-semibold text-ink">
                {d.tempLabel}
              </label>
              <span id="dhph-temp-val" class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-violet-400">20.0 °C</span>
            </div>
            <input 
              type="range" 
              id="dhph-temp" 
              min="10.0" 
              max="45.0" 
              step="1.0" 
              value="20.0" 
              class="w-full accent-violet-600 bg-surface-soft h-2 rounded-lg cursor-pointer" 
            />
            <p class="text-[11px] text-muted mt-1">{d.tempHelp}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Telemetry Output Cards -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-6">
      <div class="bg-surface border border-hairline rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-6 shadow-xs">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink mb-1">{d.diagnosticTitle}</h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-muted mb-6 leading-relaxed">{d.diagnosticSub}</p>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <!-- Log Reduction -->
          <div class="bg-surface-soft border border-hairline rounded-xl p-4">
            <div class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-muted uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
              {d.logReductionLabel}
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between">
              <span id="dhph-stat-kill" class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-emerald-400 font-mono">
                6.82 log
              </span>
              <span id="dhph-stat-kill-sub" class="text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-300">
                &gt; 99.9999% Inactivation
              </span>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-2 w-full bg-surface-strong h-1.5 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
              <div id="dhph-bar-kill" class="bg-emerald-500 h-full rounded-full transition-all duration-300" style="width: 95%;"></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Thin-Film Optical Transmittance -->
          <div class="bg-surface-soft border border-hairline rounded-xl p-4">
            <div class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-muted uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
              {d.transmittanceLabel}
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between">
              <span id="dhph-stat-trans" class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold text-sky-400 font-mono">
                91.4%
              </span>
              <span id="dhph-stat-trans-sub" class="text-xs text-muted font-mono">
                Lambert-Beer Validated
              </span>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-2 w-full bg-surface-strong h-1.5 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
              <div id="dhph-bar-trans" class="bg-sky-500 h-full rounded-full transition-all duration-300" style="width: 91%;"></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Hydrodynamic Shear Rate -->
          <div class="bg-surface-soft border border-hairline rounded-xl p-4">
            <div class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-muted uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
              {d.shearLabel}
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between">
              <span id="dhph-stat-shear" class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold text-violet-400 font-mono">
                1.42 &times; 10⁷ s⁻¹
              </span>
              <span id="dhph-stat-shear-sub" class="text-xs text-violet-300">
                PCD Micro-Nozzle
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Fluid Temperature Rise -->
          <div class="bg-surface-soft border border-hairline rounded-xl p-4">
            <div class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-muted uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
              {d.tempRiseLabel}
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between">
              <span id="dhph-stat-temp" class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold text-amber-400 font-mono">
                +2.9°C (T_exit = 22.9°C)
              </span>
              <span id="dhph-stat-temp-sub" class="text-xs text-emerald-400 font-semibold">
                Egg Coagulation: 0.0%
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Retention & Quality -->
          <div class="bg-surface-soft border border-hairline rounded-xl p-4">
            <div class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-muted uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
              {d.retentionLabel}
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between">
              <span id="dhph-stat-retention" class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold text-teal-400 font-mono">
                99.2%
              </span>
              <span class="text-xs text-muted">
                Zero Cooked Off-Flavors
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Energy & Throughput -->
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
            <div class="bg-surface-soft border border-hairline rounded-xl p-3">
              <div class="text-[10px] font-semibold text-muted uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
                {d.energyLabel}
              </div>
              <span id="dhph-stat-energy" class="text-base font-bold text-ink font-mono">
                1.85 kWh/hL
              </span>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-surface-soft border border-hairline rounded-xl p-3">
              <div class="text-[10px] font-semibold text-muted uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
                {d.throughputLabel}
              </div>
              <span id="dhph-stat-flow" class="text-base font-bold text-ink font-mono">
                3,200 L/h
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Sanitary Status -->
          <div class="bg-surface-soft border border-hairline rounded-xl p-4">
            <div class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-muted uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
              {d.statusLabel}
            </div>
            <div id="dhph-stat-status" class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-400 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse"></span>
              ASME SEC VIII &bull; 3-A 04-05 &bull; FDA 21 CFR § 120 COMPLIANT
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Interactive SVG Architecture Diagram -->
  <div class="mb-12 bg-surface border border-hairline rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xs">
    <div class="mb-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink tracking-tight mb-1">{d.diagramTitle}</h2>
      <p class="text-xs text-muted">{d.diagramSub}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="w-full overflow-x-auto">
      <svg class="w-full min-w-[760px] h-auto" viewBox="0 0 960 380" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <!-- Background Grid & Outer Envelope -->
        <rect width="960" height="380" rx="16" fill="#0B0F19" />
        <rect x="15" y="15" width="930" height="350" rx="12" stroke="#1E293B" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="6 4" />

        <!-- STAGE 1: Feed Tank & High-Pressure Intensifier Pump -->
        <g id="diagram-feed-stage">
          <rect x="35" y="110" width="110" height="160" rx="10" fill="#1E1B4B" stroke="#6366F1" stroke-width="2" />
